{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "store/an-event-added-at-an-index-its-room-holds-is-refused-nothing-written",
  "title": "A store refuses an event added at an index its room holds for another event, writing nothing, and the event at that index is kept",
  "rules": [
    "§8.1",
    "§14.3"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-8.1-009"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_store_binding_contract.py::test_an_event_at_a_held_index_is_refused; roomkit-rs testing::check_conversation_store (an added event at a held index is refused). The second event names another id and another text, so a store that kept both, or replaced the first, shows it in the timeline; an index another room holds is free in this one. Not observed: the last item, informative (what the index serves).",
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-1"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.create_room",
      "room": {
        "id": "room-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.add_event",
      "event": {
        "room_id": "room-1",
        "index": 0,
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "first"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "index": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.add_event",
      "event": {
        "room_id": "room-1",
        "index": 0,
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "second"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "event_index_taken"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "store.add_event",
      "event": {
        "room_id": "room-2",
        "index": 0,
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "elsewhere"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "index": 0
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "room-1": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "content": {
            "body": "first"
          }
        }
      ],
      "room-2": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "content": {
            "body": "elsewhere"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
